          "slide_number": 1,
          "slide_label": "Slide 1",
          "is_metafi_slide": false,
          "text": "tennis and the gym? here's the secret"
        },
        {
          "slide_number": 2,
          "slide_label": "Slide 2",
          "is_metafi_slide": false,
          "text": "save this. you'll need it at the gym"
        },
        {
          "slide_number": 3,
          "slide_label": "Slide 3",
          "is_metafi_slide": false,
          "text": "Monday. Upper Body Strength: chest, back, shoulders, arms. your legs need to be fresh for tennis tomorrow."
        },
        {
          "slide_number": 4,
          "slide_label": "Slide 4",
          "is_metafi_slide": false,
          "text": "Tuesday. Tennis: you're playing light, no beat-up legs from yesterday, so you move faster and play better."
        },
        {
          "slide_number": 5,
          "slide_label": "Slide 5",
          "is_metafi_slide": true,
          "text": "get a lifting plan that adjusts around your sport\ntry the app"
        },
        {
          "slide_number": 6,
          "slide_label": "Slide 6",
          "is_metafi_slide": false,
          "text": "Wednesday. Lower Body Strength: a day after tennis, train legs but keep it smart, not suicidal, so you don't drag the fatigue into the rest of your week."
        },
        {
          "slide_number": 7,
          "slide_label": "Slide 7",
          "is_metafi_slide": false,
          "text": "Thursday. Rest or light walk: a day to shake off the fatigue. simple walk or mobility, nothing heavy."
        },
        {
          "slide_number": 8,
          "slide_label": "Slide 8",
          "is_metafi_slide": false,
          "text": "Friday. Upper Body + Posterior Chain: back to upper, plus light posterior work (hamstrings, glutes, lower back) without wrecking your legs before tennis."
        },
        {
          "slide_number": 9,
          "slide_label": "Slide 9",
          "is_metafi_slide": false,
          "text": "Saturday. Tennis: second session, coming off a day with no heavy legs so you walk onto the court fresh."
        },
        {
          "slide_number": 10,
          "slide_label": "Slide 10",
          "is_metafi_slide": false,
          "text": "Sunday. Rest: close the week out resting. sleep well, eat well, let your body catch up."
        },
        {
          "slide_number": 11,
          "slide_label": "Slide 11",
          "is_metafi_slide": false,
          "text": "bottom line: tennis twice, gym three times, rest twice. every session gets what it needs without wrecking the other."
        }
      ]
    },
